    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap DShot (DShot150/300/600) Digital ESC Driver. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>DShot Frame Format:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>16 bits total:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Bits [15:5]: 11-bit Throttle value (0 = Disarmed/Stop, 1..47 = ESC commands, 48..2047 = Throttle command).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Bit [4]: Telemetry Request flag (1 = Request telemetry byte via bidirectional DShot).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Bits [3:0]: 4-bit CRC (computed via nibble XOR sum: <computeroutput>(payload ^ (payload &gt;&gt; 4) ^ (payload &gt;&gt; 8)) &amp; 0x0F</computeroutput>). </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
